+                    // Base patch (measured in gurukulhq: 446 modules x 334 routes, ~20 MiB of a 64 MiB Worker): every app page's client
+                    // entry has `dependOn: 'main-app'`, which makes webpack link it as a CHILD of main-app. Walking
